; Grumpy tabby Persian from "input/tabby_persian.webp", drawn by hand.
; Poses follow refs/local/cat_ref/move.pxl (same frames as sprites/white_persian.pxl), tabby markings painted on top.
name tabby_persian
size 32 32
scale 2
outline K
layout
down_0 down_1 down_2 down_3
left_0 left_1 left_2 left_3 left_4 left_5 left_6 left_7
right_0 right_1 right_2 right_3 right_4 right_5 right_6 right_7
