palette
K #1c1618 outline
W #8f8371 tabby fur
H #c6b49a light fur (back, chest fluff), warm tan like the photo's ruff
c #625a4e fur shade
d #3d372f dark tabby stripe
w #ece8df white muzzle and chin
P #b77a6c nose
e #d6cbbb pale ear tufts
Y #a7a046 green-gold eye

